  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: Nume is a science-backed supplement brand built for women navigating real health challenges - from metabolism and energy to hormonal balance and gut health. Our product collections include Performance (metabolism, energy, weight management), Relief (stress, sleep, hormonal balance), and Restore (gut health, immunity, skin, longevity). Our anchor product is GLP-1 Metabolic PRO.<br><br>• What makes us different: Every Nume box has an NFC chip built into the packaging. One tap opens Nume Plus - a 90-day guided health platform with personalized profiles, daily tracking, and AI-powered insights. No app download required. Your audience does not just get a bottle - they get a complete health experience.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Commissions range from 10% to 60% depending on your tier. Starter partners (0-15 sales) earn 35% on first subscriptions, 20% on one-time purchases, and 10% on renewals. Partner tier (15-50 sales) earns 45%/25%/15%. Elite partners (50+ sales) earn up to 60% on first subscriptions, 35% on one-time purchases, and 20% on every renewal. Recurring revenue means you earn every month your audience stays subscribed.<br><br>• How to promote us: Receive free product and a creative kit with product photos, b-roll footage, and talking points. Share authentically with your audience - no scripts, no hard sells. You get a unique discount code and your own branded landing page with your photo and story. Whitelisting opportunities are available where we run your content as paid ads with our budget.<br><br>• Other information: Applications are reviewed within 48 hours. Payouts are processed monthly. No minimum followers required. Track every click, sale, and commission in real-time through your partner dashboard.</p></div></div>",
